    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n47297" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Sȳrinx</span></b> , ingis (also <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Sȳringa</span></b> , ae,
